    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kainaikab laitorinik che kigibar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chu ko laitorinikab emonoto, che kibar lagokab Israel, ak konam emenywa kobunji eng’ Jordan bitonin, ole tokyingei ole chorune asista, koboch atebwetab Arnon kot koit tulwetab Hermon, ak Araba tugul ne tokyingei kong’asis: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihon laitoriatab Amorik, ne kimenyei Hesbon, ne kibou koboch Aroer, ne mi tabandab atebwetab Arnon, ak koboch kwenutab atebwet, ak kebebertab Gilead, kot koit ainetab Jabok, kiwotetab lagokab Amon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Araba agoi nyanjetab Kinerot, ne tokyingei kong’asis, kot koit nyanjetab Araba, ne noto Araraita ne bo Munyuk, ne tokyingei kong’asis, oret ne wendi Bet-jesimot; ak eng’ murot ne bo tai, eng’ chepkeigeusiekab Pisga kel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiwotetab Og laitoriatab Basan, ne bo che king’etune Repaik, che kimenyei Astarot ak Edrei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kibounisiei eng’ tulwetab Hermon, ak Saleka, ak Basan komugul, kot koit kiwotetab Gesurik, ak Maakatik, ak kebeberta ne bo Gilead, kiwotetab Sihon laitoriatab Hesbon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibar Musa, otwogindetab Jehovah koboto lagokab Israel ichek: ak kogochi Musa otwogindetab Jehovah emonoto bikab Reuben ak che bo Gad ak kebebertab bororietab Manase, kobunji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuto laitorinikab emonoto che kibar Josua ak lagokab Israel eng’ Jordan bitonin ole tokyingei cherongo, koboch Baal-gad eng’ atebwetab Lebanon kot koit tulwetab Halak, ne togostoi agoi Seir; ak kiigochi Josua emonoto bororiosiekab Israel kobunji ko u pcheutikwak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eng’ emetab tulonok, ak eng’ warenget, ak eng’ Araba, ak eng’ chepkeigeusiek, ak eng’ ong’atet, ak eng’ Murot ne bo Tai; Hitik, ak Amorik, ak Kananik, ak Perisik, ak Hibik, ak Jebusik: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laitoriatab Jeriko, agenge; laitoriatab Ai, ne mi ole negite Bet-el, agenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laitoriatab Jerusalem, agenge; laitoriatab Hebron, agenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laitoriatab Jarmut, agenge; laitoriatab Lakis, agenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laitoriatab Eglon, agenge; laitoriatab Geser, agenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
